  "description": "Turn mess into perfection and experience the satisfaction of a job well done.\n\nStep into the role of a professional cleaner and take on a variety of tasks across different locations, from small apartments to large industrial spaces. Every job challenges you to restore order, remove dirt, and bring each environment back to a spotless condition.\n\nUse a wide range of tools and cleaning methods to handle different types of mess. Wash surfaces, remove stains, collect trash, and organise objects while paying attention to every detail. Each space requires a different approach, pushing you to think, plan, and work efficiently.\n\nAs you progress, you take on more complex jobs, earn money, and improve your equipment. Better tools help you clean faster and handle tougher environments, allowing you to grow from a beginner into a true cleaning expert.\n\nKey Features:\n- Realistic Cleaning Gameplay: Interact with surfaces, dirt, and objects\n- Variety of Locations: Clean homes, offices, restaurants, and more\n- Multiple Tools: Use mops, vacuums, sprays, and advanced equipment\n- Progression System: Earn rewards and upgrade your gear\n- Detailed Environments: Discover and clean every corner\n\nFrom simple tasks to full-scale cleaning challenges, every job brings a sense of progress and satisfaction.\n\nHouse Cleaning Simulator offers a relaxing yet engaging experience where precision, organisation, and attention to detail make all the difference.",
